WEBVTT

00:29.210 --> 00:32.220
Let's kick it up a notch, Itadori!

00:32.220 --> 00:33.580
This will be the last time

00:33.580 --> 00:36.480
you and I curse each other!

00:40.200 --> 00:41.880
Hey, now.

00:41.880 --> 00:44.350
Are you leaving me out?

01:02.120 --> 01:03.330
He severed it himself?!

01:25.600 --> 01:27.230
Soul Multiplicity.

01:28.140 --> 01:34.080
By combining souls with weak 
rejection, it creates an amalgamation.

01:34.190 --> 01:36.720
Polymorphic Soul Isomer!

01:37.560 --> 01:39.440
What is that transfigured human?!

01:52.890 --> 01:56.080
Given that he's able to 
hold off me and my brother,

01:56.080 --> 02:00.370
the distribution of power 
between his bodies is likely 2 to 8.

02:05.640 --> 02:09.020
And the weakened 2 is the main body!

02:09.020 --> 02:12.570
I'll make certain my brother crushes it!

02:15.160 --> 02:19.800
I've heard its transfigured humans 
are around grade 3 or a weak grade 2!

02:19.800 --> 02:23.270
Crush it quickly, Aoi Todo!

02:26.440 --> 02:27.370
What?!

02:27.370 --> 02:28.440
Todo!

02:30.030 --> 02:31.890
That's for underestimating me!

03:00.500 --> 03:02.250
It's dead?

03:03.120 --> 03:07.160
It had so much power, 
yet it only took a single blow?

03:11.200 --> 03:13.180
Now I see!

03:13.450 --> 03:20.080
It managed to gain explosive power by 
burning through multiple souls in an instant!

03:20.080 --> 03:22.770
It's an extremely offense-oriented 
transfigured human.

03:22.770 --> 03:24.360
And...

03:25.180 --> 03:27.320
there are two more?

03:34.380 --> 03:38.380
Forgive me, you pitiful souls.

03:49.560 --> 03:54.080
JUJUTSU KAISEN
Shibuya Incident

05:16.450 --> 05:19.560
I've finished getting us away 
from the topknot gorilla.

05:19.560 --> 05:20.710
Now to just

05:21.010 --> 05:22.610
take him down!

06:30.770 --> 06:31.870
Tsk.

06:35.010 --> 06:40.200
It would seem you're dead 
set on leaving me out, huh?

06:40.870 --> 06:44.880
I guess I couldn't completely take him down 
with two Polymorphic Soul Isomers.

06:47.640 --> 06:51.700
Landing any blow on this guy 
is a rather steep hurdle.

06:52.130 --> 06:55.260
But if I unleash my domain,

06:58.560 --> 07:01.310
I'll touch Sukuna and get killed.

07:02.320 --> 07:04.630
Barriers are complex.

07:04.630 --> 07:08.560
I already revealed the option 
of excluding him from my domain.

07:08.560 --> 07:11.820
The same ploy won't work on Itadori again.

07:11.820 --> 07:14.230
So what do I do, then?

07:14.230 --> 07:17.120
The one who taught me that was...

07:19.960 --> 07:21.840
Domain Expansion:

07:23.130 --> 07:25.890
Self-Embodiment of Perfection!

07:27.460 --> 07:29.700
I thought that was suicide for it?!

07:30.210 --> 07:32.160
It's a desperate gamble!

07:32.160 --> 07:35.220
On a 0.2-second domain expansion!

07:38.730 --> 07:41.510
Todo moved to protect himself 
from the domain,

07:41.510 --> 07:44.900
activating the Simple Domain he 
learned directly from Yuki Tsukumo.

07:47.160 --> 07:51.200
Itadori acted even faster, 
racing forth to exorcise Mahito

07:51.200 --> 07:53.520
before he unleashed Idle Transfiguration.

07:55.610 --> 07:58.990
Though Mahito activated his 
technique even faster than that.

07:58.990 --> 08:00.300
The manifestation of an innate domain

08:00.300 --> 08:02.040
is usually followed by 
the activation of a technique,

08:02.040 --> 08:05.290
but he merged those two 
separate steps into one.

08:05.290 --> 08:09.400
It was an act of speed made possible by his 
awakened state that followed Black Flash.

08:12.760 --> 08:16.510
I take it I'm safe this time, Sukuna?

08:18.330 --> 08:22.850
Knowing you, you have some kind of 
backup plan with Itadori, right?

08:23.760 --> 08:25.280
I won't let you, though.

08:25.680 --> 08:28.690
I'll kill Itadori before 
you switch with him.

08:28.690 --> 08:31.030
So shut up and watch from here.

08:52.050 --> 08:53.440
Todo!

08:58.810 --> 09:02.770
Come on, I just made you more fashionable.

09:03.310 --> 09:07.170
After deploying a domain, 
the technique engraved into the body

09:07.170 --> 09:10.070
is temporarily burned out,
and using it proves challenging.

09:10.070 --> 09:15.360
Mahito already understood that after 
his flight from Satozakura High School.

09:17.230 --> 09:19.420
Black Flash!

09:22.400 --> 09:24.280
He just...

09:24.280 --> 09:28.370
focused all his damn cursed 
energy in his stomach on instinct!

09:34.510 --> 09:37.030
However, my technique has recovered!

09:37.030 --> 09:38.840
And he can't clap his hands anymore!

09:39.050 --> 09:41.860
This time, I'll kill him for certain!

09:56.990 --> 09:57.870
Huh?

09:58.740 --> 09:59.860
Huh?

10:00.520 --> 10:01.360
Huh?

10:02.510 --> 10:04.770
Takada-chan - "Climax☆JUMPING!"

10:02.510 --> 10:50.440
*Todo's imagination

10:56.050 --> 10:56.920
Shit!

10:58.620 --> 11:01.050
Black Flash!

11:05.800 --> 11:06.800
Hmph!

11:06.800 --> 11:09.200
It was just for a moment, but I touched him.

11:09.200 --> 11:12.220
It's a miracle I got off with only this.

11:24.550 --> 11:27.090
Leave the rest to me, Todo!

11:27.490 --> 11:30.200
Thank you, Todo!

11:32.010 --> 11:33.180
Damn it!

11:33.180 --> 11:36.500
I can't believe I took another 
Black Flash dead-on at that moment!

11:36.500 --> 11:40.000
That damn gorilla screwed 
with me until the very end.

11:40.410 --> 11:43.000
But now I've finally grasped it.

11:43.000 --> 11:48.010
The true essence of my soul! Its true shape!

11:49.010 --> 11:51.010
Idle Transfiguration...

12:03.960 --> 12:06.490
Instant Spirit Body of Distorted Killing!

12:06.950 --> 12:09.940
It's a happy birthday,

12:10.550 --> 12:12.000
Itadori!

12:15.420 --> 12:17.970
JUJUTSU KAISEN

12:15.420 --> 12:17.970
JUJUTSU KAISEN

12:18.500 --> 12:22.280
This isn't a transformation 
as just a means, like before.

12:23.680 --> 12:25.260
What's different?

12:25.720 --> 12:28.440
I understood after using Black Flash.

12:28.440 --> 12:32.480
What my true, unbridled soul is.

12:32.480 --> 12:34.400
I'm shocked.

12:34.400 --> 12:37.510
You didn't strike me as the type 
to go on a journey of self-discovery.

12:38.630 --> 12:40.050
That's true.

12:40.540 --> 12:43.480
But I'm just starting on the final touches.

12:43.480 --> 12:48.740
After I kill you, I'll finally 
be truly born into this world.

13:29.120 --> 13:30.510
So tough!

13:30.510 --> 13:31.870
Its bare body

13:31.870 --> 13:33.410
is even harder than his was!

13:52.300 --> 13:55.150
I understood after using Black Flash.

13:55.150 --> 13:59.050
What my true, unbridled soul is.

13:59.350 --> 14:01.400
Is that what he meant?!

14:22.170 --> 14:23.800
This thing has already...

14:23.800 --> 14:25.850
become something on a different level

14:25.850 --> 14:28.000
than the cursed spirit he was 
prior to transforming?!

14:59.450 --> 15:02.240
If I want to defeat this thing,

15:03.010 --> 15:07.420
I'll have to hit him with a Black Flash

15:03.960 --> 15:07.230
There is no sorcerer who can unleash a Black Flash at will

15:09.360 --> 15:11.260
using my maximum cursed energy!

15:26.740 --> 15:30.050
Even if I only used it for 
a moment, getting hit with

15:30.050 --> 15:32.760
a Black Flash right after my 
domain expansion was real bad.

15:47.500 --> 15:49.250
We're both

15:50.120 --> 15:53.080
still brimming with energy, huh?!

16:17.400 --> 16:20.800
There is no one who can unleash 
a Black Flash at will.

16:21.160 --> 16:26.420
But something about him convinces 
me that the current Itadori can.

16:27.850 --> 16:29.300
In which case...

16:58.590 --> 17:00.580
A time lag?!

17:12.250 --> 17:13.840
Hey, cursed spirit.

17:13.840 --> 17:16.720
There's no way you don't understand this.

17:17.840 --> 17:20.410
Arms are just decorations.

17:20.930 --> 17:22.800
The act of applause

17:22.800 --> 17:26.760
is an acclamation of the soul!

17:29.130 --> 17:32.160
I haven't switched places?!

17:32.160 --> 17:34.030
It's unfortunate.

17:34.520 --> 17:39.040
My Boogie Woogie is already dead.

17:49.790 --> 17:52.360
Black Flash!

18:23.670 --> 18:25.020
Not yet!

18:25.460 --> 18:26.780
Not yet!

18:32.220 --> 18:35.090
My stock of transfigured humans is also out!

18:35.090 --> 18:37.600
I'll accept it, Mahito.

18:39.800 --> 18:41.280
I am you.

18:42.670 --> 18:44.900
I wanted to reject you.

18:45.720 --> 18:48.520
I wanted to pretend I didn't 
understand what you said.

18:50.610 --> 18:52.040
But that's different now.

18:52.870 --> 18:54.600
I'll just kill you.

18:54.920 --> 18:59.110
And if you're ever reborn again as 
a new curse, I'll kill you then, too.

18:59.470 --> 19:01.720
You can change your name 
and change your appearance,

19:01.720 --> 19:03.360
but I'll still kill you again and again.

19:03.950 --> 19:06.130
I don't need meaning or 
a reason for it anymore.

19:06.870 --> 19:09.490
Maybe there will be 
some meaning to be found

19:09.960 --> 19:13.620
from my actions several 
centuries after I'm dead.

19:14.490 --> 19:20.140
But I'm sure I'm just... 
one big cog in the wheel.

19:21.090 --> 19:24.070
And I'll keep on killing curses 
until I rust away.

19:24.640 --> 19:29.640
Because that is my role in this war.

21:46.820 --> 21:48.480
Geto!

21:48.960 --> 21:52.000
Shall I save you, Mahito?

21:51.990 --> 21:54.990
Episode 45
Metamorphosis

23:25.220 --> 23:28.530
A contrived fate may not be true destiny.

23:28.530 --> 23:34.760
But the moment such fake destinies 
intertwine will nonetheless be true destiny.

23:34.760 --> 23:36.920
Next time, "Metamorphosis, Part 2."

23:34.760 --> 23:41.430
Next Episode
Metamorphosis, Part 2

23:36.920 --> 23:39.640
Some things can only be cultivated under pretenses.
